  "details": "I know it was to help prevent crashes and stuff but quest barely even crashed as it was I think the option to disable it on quest would make it better because pretty sure a lot of crashes now were because of poor internet connection not vrchat, a few of my friends are talking about leaving vrchat because their avatars look so bad now when they are the only one in the world, it’s an avatar he spent a lot of time making so the fact that it now looks like crap because of mipmap streaming just devalues the effort he put into it\n\nI’m only suggesting that we can disable it if we choose because some people might actually gain less crashing from it but that doesn’t mean it should be enforced for everyone",
